think Designed compose-not-braid before coding: this rung owns only the union-find (find with path halving, union keeping the smaller label as root), the raster-order two-pass sweep, and the compaction. Foreground is read through branch.is_on -- the one binary door (red >= 128) hitmiss/endpoints/zhang_suen already share -- and qoi owns the buffer. colorize is the natural render so a labeling is a real image the QOI codec round-trips.
think Bounded before a byte: a component never opens more than one provisional label per pixel, so the parent array is sized to the pixel count and TooManyLabels guards the impossible overflow by name; an empty source refuses by name having allocated nothing.
